'''Manic Island Cat''' (大狂乱のネコ島 ''Dai Kyōran no Neko Shima'', '''Insane Island Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Ogre Island (Deadly)|Fish Maniac]]. It was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

