[[Infernal Tower/Floor 35|Infernal Tower - Floor 35]]
|money drop = 520¢ - 2,054¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has mediocre health and insane DPS, so you have to treat it like a less durable [[R.Ost]] with only 1 knockback but more DPS. You'll have to deploy many meatshields and rangers when warding them off. This enemy's biggest weaknesses lie in its low range and speed.

==Strategy==
Due to Manic Island Cat's high DPS but somewhat low-ish health, the best way to deal with it is to spam [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] that can outrange it like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama/Slapsticks Cats]]. It will still probably advance and kill some of your stack, but killing a stack of these will allow you to recover your losses and spam more of them.

[[Ogre Island (Deadly)|Ogre Island]] is the first stage in which Manic Island Cat appears in, which has a [[Berserkory]] in it. Naturally, any ranged [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] units are optimal, namely [[Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo (Uber Rare Cat)|Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo]] or [[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-00]]. Because of the Manic Island's extreme DPS at close range, [[Octopus Cat]] will be unable to consistently block Berserkory's waves.

